BT /F1 11 Tf 50 740 Td 15 TL (INDUSTRIAL INSPECTION GUIDELINES & SEVERITY STANDARDS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Document ID: SOP-INSP-003) Tj T*
(Document Type: sop) Tj T*
(Revision: Rev 1.4) Tj T*
(Effective Date: 2026-02-15) Tj T*
(Department: Quality Assurance & Reliability) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Inspection Regimes and Frequency) Tj T*
(Rotating machinery must undergo systematic surveillance:) Tj T*
(  - Daily routine inspection: Thermal imaging, surface temperature, audible checks.) Tj T*
(  - Monthly comprehensive inspection: Vibration spectral analysis, oil sampling.) Tj T*
(  - Quarterly shutdown audit: Internal bearing clearance, seal inspection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Severity Classification Matrix) Tj T*
(Observations must be categorized according to deviation from baseline:) Tj T*
(  - HIGH SEVERITY: Parameter exceeds continuous limit by > 10% \(e.g. Temp > 88 C\).) Tj T*
(    Action: Immediate operational restriction and expedited maintenance review.) Tj T*
(  - MEDIUM SEVERITY: Parameter between normal baseline and limit \(75 C - 80 C\).) Tj T*
(    Action: Schedule maintenance inspection within 48 hours.) Tj T*
(  - LOW SEVERITY: Minor aesthetic or non-functional observation \(e.g. minor paint wear\).) Tj T*
(    Action: Log observation and monitor during next scheduled cycle.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
