(3. Evidence Recording and Traceability) Tj T*
(Every recorded inspection finding must capture:) Tj T*
(  - Asset / equipment identifier \(e.g. Pump-03\)) Tj T*
(  - Quantitative observed value with physical unit of measurement \(e.g. 92 C\)) Tj T*
(  - Benchmark operating limit from authoritative SOP \(e.g. 80 C\)) Tj T*
(  - Exact document source, page number, and paragraph citation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Approval Note Preparation) Tj T*
(Approval notes must synthesize findings, technical analysis against SOP thresholds,) Tj T*
(risk rating, recommended remedial actions, and authoritative references.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
